e,"text":"Peach Girl is about an average high school girl, Momo Adachi, who everyone thinks is a beach bunny / slut because of her tanned skin. The actual reason she is so tanned is because she was on the swim team and tans very easily. She likes a boy, Toji, who she heard only likes non-tanned girls. This causes her to question who she is and have low self esteem. She spends a lot of time trying to remake herself into the girl she believes he wants. However, she has a friend, Sae, who likes to go behind Momo's back and make her life terrible, mostly by trying to take Toji away from her. All the while there's another boy, Kairi, who is in love with Momo.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gyaru","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swimming","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fashion","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pregnancy","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Delinquents","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Peach Girl: Super Pop Love Hurricane","english":"Peach Girl: Super Pop Love Hurricane","native":"ピーチガール","romaji":"Peach Girl","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"蜜桃女孩"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}